        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L35",
          "text": "## Meta"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L37",
          "text": "Configure sets one value of the configuration at a time, never the whole; a subscription follows the configuration as it changes. SubscriberCapacity is positive, and an active subscription follows it. The meta surface, the root of the Nexus, may act on any pane; the ordinary surface acts only on the panes its caller owns."
        },
