        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L179",
          "text": "## Operation"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L181",
          "text": "One attempt per input. An attempt reads and writes Memory and may compose several Emissions, each one herdr call; every attempt ends in the shared Outcome. The Operation turns what the Emission observed into the shared Outcome."
        },
        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L183",
          "text": "```ethos"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L184",
          "text": "Operation"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L185",
          "text": "[ herdr:[ Session Pane Workspace     ; imports"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L186",
          "text": "          Command Text Keys Label ]"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "vision:herdr-nexus-v1:L187",
          "text": "  :herdr:AttemptOutcome.Outcome ]"
        },
        {
